  Ready to launch
  Setup keeps your answers until you quit. Launching sets the sandbox up with
  them.

  Launching
    1  Creates a local cluster, and a tunnel so Keycard can reach it
    2  Sets up your zone: the sandbox's app, access rules and credentials
    3  Starts the agent, and checks that it works
    It takes two to four minutes the first time. You can watch each step.

   enter  Launch    e  Change a setting


  enter  launch   e  change a setting   esc  dashboard   q  quit
